      "body": "Changing `BOOST_CHECK_MESSAGE` to remove failure context is surprising in a PR framed around removing `BOOST_FAIL` and adding info.\r\n\r\nTo include the parsing checks in the context too, we could wrap the whole `DoCheck` body in `BOOST_TEST_CONTEXT(\"Priv desc: \" << prv, \"Pub desc: \" << pub)`.\r\n",
