      "body": "The message now just restates the assertion. We could use a conditional `BOOST_CHECK_EQUAL` instead:\n\n```diff\n-    BOOST_CHECK_MESSAGE(is_combo || parse_priv->ScriptSize() == scripts[0][0].size() / 2, \"Invalid ScriptSize()\");\n+    if (!is_combo) BOOST_CHECK_EQUAL(parse_priv->ScriptSize().value(), scripts[0][0].size() / 2);\n```\n\n(`.value()` also makes a missing size fail explicitly.)\n",
